00:42:24.380 --> 00:42:28.100
but you see it ever so slightly at the end when she runs in the conference room.
但在结尾她跑进会议室时，你可以隐约看到一点。

981
00:42:28.180 --> 00:42:28.460
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

982
00:42:28.880 --> 00:42:31.800
Andy had on men's sleeve garters.
安迪戴着男士袖箍。

983
00:42:32.120 --> 00:42:32.620
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

984
00:42:32.780 --> 00:42:36.980
And I couldn't see what everyone else had, but those were the main ones that were visible.
我没看清其他人有什么，但这些是主要的可见道具。

985
00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:42.580
So, Andy is going to try to teach Pam how to do a better accent, because everyone's saying
所以，安迪打算教帕姆如何说出更好的口音，因为每个人都说

986
00:42:42.580 --> 00:42:44.180
she just sounds like Forrest Gump.
她听起来就像阿甘。

987
00:42:44.180 --> 00:42:52.460
And he is able to do, like, a Florida panhandle accent, and then he gets into his description
他能够模仿佛罗里达狭长地带的口音，然后他开始描述

988
00:42:52.460 --> 00:42:57.880
of a Savannah accent, where he says it's like molasses coming out of your mouth.
萨凡纳口音，他说那就像嘴里流出的糖蜜一样。

989
00:42:58.240 --> 00:42:59.400
It's so good.
太棒了。

990
00:42:59.940 --> 00:43:05.380
Danny said they were originally planning for Andy to have a horrible accent, but on the
丹尼说他们原本计划让安迪说一种糟糕的口音，但在拍摄

