day, they realized that Ed was very good at these different accents, and so they rewrote it.
当天，他们意识到艾德非常擅长这些不同的口音，于是他们重写了剧本。

992
00:43:13.280 --> 00:43:18.780
Well, he is from Georgia, and he probably has a good ear for all the accents there.
嗯，他是佐治亚州人，可能对那里的各种口音很有耳感。

993
00:43:19.320 --> 00:43:24.900
Interestingly enough, there was an Andy talking head in the shooting draft that did not make it.
有趣的是，拍摄剧本里原本有一段安迪的采访镜头，但没能保留下来。

994
00:43:25.160 --> 00:43:26.580
This is what it said.
内容是这样的。

995
00:43:27.170 --> 00:43:31.280
I went to dialect camp every summer from the age 7 to 18.
我从7岁到18岁，每年夏天都去参加方言夏令营。

996
00:43:31.680 --> 00:43:34.300
Then I was a counselor for 10 years.
然后我当了10年的辅导员。

997
00:43:34.820 --> 00:43:35.240
Hmm.
嗯。

998
00:43:35.720 --> 00:43:36.260
What?
什么？

999
00:43:36.400 --> 00:43:37.640
It was Andy's childhood.
那是安迪的童年。

1000
00:43:37.640 --> 00:43:43.620
So, we learned in the meeting that he spent a summer in Toulouse apprenticing for a Fomagier.
所以，我们在会议中得知，他曾在图卢兹度过一个夏天，师从一位奶酪师学艺。

1001
00:43:44.000 --> 00:43:48.500
Now we find out that he went to a dialect camp for years.
现在我们发现他去过一个方言训练营好几年。

1002
00:43:48.900 --> 00:43:54.200
Well, it's interesting, Angela, because we have wondered if deleted scenes count.
嗯，这很有趣，安吉拉，因为我们一直在想删减片段算不算数。

1003
00:43:54.420 --> 00:44:00.140
If something doesn't make it into an episode, does it still count in that character's lore
如果有些内容没能进入正片，那它在那个角色的背景故事中还算数吗？

1004
00:44:00.140 --> 00:44:01.220
in the story?
在剧情里？

1005
00:44:01.420 --> 00:44:01.900
Right.
没错。

1006
00:44:02.020 --> 00:44:02.280
What not?
为什么不算？

1007
00:44:02.280 --> 00:44:06.660
And sort of in the canon of the show, is it part of that?
在剧集的正史里，它算是其中的一部分吗？

1008
00:44:06.940 --> 00:44:09.520
And we sort of said, no.
我们当时大概是说，不算。

1009
00:44:09.720 --> 00:44:09.900
No.
不算。

1010
00:44:10.340 --> 00:44:11.480
It's what aired.
播出的才算。

1011
00:44:11.760 --> 00:44:12.260
Yes.
是的。

1012
00:44:12.420 --> 00:44:14.680
That is what would be the show Bible.
那才是剧集的官方设定。

1013
00:44:15.040 --> 00:44:22.220
Well, I found an old article on officetally.com from 2007.
嗯，我在officetally.com上找到了一篇2007年的旧文章。

1014
00:44:22.700 --> 00:44:24.260
Right when Google started.
就在谷歌刚起步的时候。

1015
00:44:24.720 --> 00:44:25.320
Right.
没错。

1016
00:44:27.960 --> 00:44:30.400
There was an interview with Greg Daniels.
那是对格雷格·丹尼尔斯的采访。

1017
00:44:30.580 --> 00:44:32.020
And he talked about this?
他谈到这个了吗？

1018
00:44:32.140 --> 00:44:32.400
Yes.
是的。

1019
00:44:32.640 --> 00:44:33.220
What did he say?
他说了什么？

1020
00:44:33.820 --> 00:44:34.920
He said, quote,
他说，引用如下：

1021
00:44:35.180 --> 00:44:39.440
For the writers, in our minds, those scenes have happened.
对于编剧来说，在我们心里，那些场景是发生过的。

1022
00:44:39.440 --> 00:44:45.060
We wrote them, we shot them, and at the last minute, I cut them in the editing room.
我们写了，拍了，只是在最后一刻，我在剪辑室里把它们剪掉了。

1023
00:44:45.260 --> 00:44:49.600
But we're relying on them anyway for the mythology of the show.
但无论如何，我们还是把它们作为剧集背景设定的一部分来参考。

1024
00:44:49.600 --> 00:44:51.180
Oh, wow.
噢，哇。

1025
00:44:51.440 --> 00:44:51.660
Okay.
好吧。

1026
00:44:51.980 --> 00:44:56.600
So, per Greg, if it made it in the shooting draft.
所以，按照格雷格的说法，如果它出现在了拍摄剧本里。

1027
00:44:56.840 --> 00:44:58.140
If we shot it.
如果我们拍了它。

1028
00:44:58.280 --> 00:44:58.780
Right.
没错。

1029
00:44:59.140 --> 00:45:01.280
Then it's part of the mythology of the show.
那它就是剧集背景设定的一部分。

1030
00:45:01.440 --> 00:45:01.560
Right.
没错。

1031
00:45:01.560 --> 00:45:05.320
So, that would mean that, yes, Andy did spend a summer as a fromagier.
所以，这意味着，是的，安迪确实当过一个夏天的奶酪师。

1032
00:45:05.740 --> 00:45:09.080
He did do this weird accent camp.
他确实参加过这个奇怪的口音训练营。

1033
00:45:10.140 --> 00:45:11.840
But here is the problem.
但问题来了。

1034
00:45:12.200 --> 00:45:12.380
What?
什么？

1035
00:45:12.380 --> 00:45:16.820
But the exception that proves the rule would be Pam's painting.
但证明规则的例外应该是帕姆的画。

1036
00:45:17.500 --> 00:45:21.480
Because Pam's painting, they shot it being destroyed.
因为帕姆的画，他们拍了它被毁掉的镜头。

1037
00:45:21.760 --> 00:45:24.640
It stayed off the wall for several episodes.
它在好几集里都没挂在墙上。

1038
00:45:24.660 --> 00:45:26.560
It's still off the wall in this episode.
在这一集里它依然没挂在墙上。

1039
00:45:26.740 --> 00:45:29.720
In this episode, there's still just golfing inspiration.
在这一集里，墙上还是只有高尔夫励志画。

1040
00:45:30.700 --> 00:45:32.000
But it came back.
但它后来又回来了。

1041
00:45:33.640 --> 00:45:35.100
So, I don't know.
所以，我不知道。

1042
00:45:35.580 --> 00:45:37.520
I think it's still up for debate, Greg.
我觉得这还有待商榷，格雷格。

1043
00:45:38.080 --> 00:45:38.980
Sorry, Greg.
抱歉，格雷格。

1044
00:45:39.440 --> 00:45:40.360
We don't know.
我们不知道。

1045
00:45:40.360 --> 00:45:44.260
This interview does predate the destruction of the painting.
这次采访的时间早于那幅画被毁的时间。

1046
00:45:44.660 --> 00:45:47.840
So, he's allowed to change his mind on that one.
所以，他有权在那件事上改变主意。

1047
00:45:48.340 --> 00:45:50.600
People are pretty impressed by Andy's accents.
大家对安迪的口音印象相当深刻。

1048
00:45:50.840 --> 00:45:51.960
Kevin has a requeSt.
凯文有个请求。

1049
00:45:52.180 --> 00:45:53.220
The sweetest chef.
最甜美的厨师。

1050
00:45:54.080 --> 00:45:56.020
Andy's like, what province is he from?
安迪就像是，他是哪个省的人？

1051
00:45:56.360 --> 00:45:59.400
